{"title":"Martial Wild West","synopsis":"Di Dimensi Alternatif dimana Dinasti Han tidak pernah jatuh seni bela diri adalah kekuatan yang digunakan untuk memeras rakyat kecil namun ketika sebuah benua baru ditemukan orang baik dan jahat samasama Berlomba untuk menetap di sana dan melarikan diri dari tirani Kaisar membuka era Martial Wild West\nDi perbatasan dimana perang sedang bergejolak Zhang Qian seorang pria yang bereinkarnasi dari dunia modern namun dunia barunya ini tidak seperti dunia fantastik yang ia impikan dari membaca novel Martial Arts Martial Arts di dunia barunya memang sangat kuat Namun terlalu kasar dan kurang elegan karena itu Qian melakukan perjalanan ke benua baru untuk mimpinya membawa True Martial Arts kembali martial Realm yang baru","alternative_title":"무림서부","author":"Cup Ramen","artist":"Jeong Han-Gill","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Martial Arts","Murim","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"c9df58a4-2d58-4d1c-9503-8988c47be5d1","number":"129","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"961e3802-7ff5-4379-96f9-5738eeae8ee0","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"bd07351e-2e8e-4409-9084-1c1a5946478a","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"3d4d48a3-a775-43db-940d-7ff319248e00","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"id":"6f293747-bc8e-420c-a647-97dd774205d3","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"aef73848-40f3-4411-91bd-f4f630a51313","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"bafef1c1-cf5d-4050-8455-c3295514969b","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"id":"11535df4-ebc2-43a3-9022-d4e93b0a66e0","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"3346112d-4d3d-4ba5-800a-d087c7f920fd","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2026-04-28","images":[]},{"id":"ce637c4d-d79e-4426-9bbe-7047c3d